INSTALLATION
------------

Step 1) Extract the compressed mobywat source package

$ tar -xvf mobywat.tgz

Step 2) Enter mobywat/src

$ cd mobywat/src

Step 3) Type "make" at the command prompt

$ make

Step 4) Now, your executable named "mobywat" is ready for use in mobywat/src

-----------------
You may also type

$ make install
to copy mobywat executable to $HOME/bin

and/or

$ make clean
to remove object and binary files from mobywat/src
